    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it just feels so heavy. like i'm just going through the motions of a person who used to have something to say, but that person is dead now. the world just keeps demanding more, more art, more life, more stuff... but i'm just empty. it feels like there's no point in even trying to refill a well that's completely dried up. what am i even doing here?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
